From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elkir0 <elkir0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/24] ARM: gts28ltexx_defconfig: firewall, containers, zram,
 PSI, uinput, IIO

Built in for the Omarchy (Hyprland) rootfs, which ships no modules:
nftables and iptables/ip6tables with the xt matches ufw uses, VETH and
BRIDGE(_NETFILTER) for containers, FUSE, ZRAM with the lz4 and zstd
backends, PSI, INPUT_UINPUT (needs INPUT_MISC), and IIO with the
milestone-7 sensor drivers (no effect until their DT nodes are in the
default board file).

Checked on the SM-T715: nft table/chain/rule with ct state, iptables -L,
bridge and veth creation, /dev/fuse, zram-control, /proc/pressure,
/dev/uinput.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig | 60 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 60 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
index 35408e73e..d62f62dec 100644
--- a/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/gts28ltexx_defconfig
@@ -171,3 +171,63 @@ CONFIG_RMI4_F12=y
 # and the first built-in boot looped (watchdog reset -> sboot boots
 # RECOVERY again).  Loaded by hand / by the initramfs after the guard.
 CONFIG_DRM_PANFROST=m
+
+# Requested by the Omarchy (Hyprland) track, built in because the rootfs
+# ships no modules.  Firewall for ufw / iptables-nft (omarchy-mobile's
+# kernel fragment):
+CONFIG_NETFILTER=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_ADVANCED=y
+CONFIG_NF_CONNTRACK=y
+CONFIG_NF_TABLES=y
+CONFIG_NF_TABLES_INET=y
+CONFIG_NF_TABLES_IPV4=y
+CONFIG_NF_TABLES_IPV6=y
+CONFIG_NFT_CT=y
+CONFIG_NFT_NAT=y
+CONFIG_NFT_MASQ=y
+CONFIG_NFT_REJECT=y
+CONFIG_NFT_COMPAT=y
+CONFIG_NFT_LOG=y
+CONFIG_NFT_LIMIT=y
+CONFIG_NFT_FIB_INET=y
+CONFIG_NFT_FIB_IPV4=y
+CONFIG_NFT_FIB_IPV6=y
+CONFIG_NF_NAT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XTABLES=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_IPTABLES=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_FILTER=y
+CONFIG_IP_NF_TARGET_REJECT=y
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_IPTABLES=y
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_FILTER=y
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_TARGET_REJECT=y
+CONFIG_IP6_NF_MATCH_RT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_STATE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_CONNTRACK=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_OWNER=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_LIMIT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_ADDRTYPE=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_MULTIPORT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_RECENT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_COMMENT=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_HL=y
+CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_TARGET_LOG=y
+# Container networking (Docker on the tablet)
+CONFIG_VETH=y
+CONFIG_BRIDGE=y
+CONFIG_BRIDGE_NETFILTER=y
+# Document portal (xdg-desktop-portal), gvfs
+CONFIG_FUSE_FS=y
+# Compressed swap in RAM (3 GiB of RAM)
+CONFIG_ZSMALLOC=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_LZ4=y
+CONFIG_ZRAM_BACKEND_ZSTD=y
+# Pressure stall information, virtual input devices
+CONFIG_PSI=y
+CONFIG_INPUT_MISC=y
+CONFIG_INPUT_UINPUT=y
+# IIO and the milestone-7 sensor drivers (auto-rotation); the sensor DT
+# nodes are still in exynos5433-gts28ltexx-m7.dtsi, untested on the device.
+CONFIG_IIO=y
+CONFIG_IIO_ST_LSM6DSX=y
+CONFIG_YAMAHA_YAS530=y
